{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf5hHwUSH6AegoRUiheuZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass. The command `./mvnw test` from sample-service/ completed successfully with 17 tests (9 in ShipmentControllerTest including the 4 new tests I added).\n\n**Result:** BUILD SUCCESS\n\n**Failures:** None\n\n**Fixes:** No fixes were needed; the implementation worked correctly on first run.\n\n```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** — `./mvnw test` returned BUILD SUCCESS\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** — All original 5 ShipmentControllerTest tests still pass, plus 4 new ones (9 total), all ShipmentControllerTest tests pass\n3. ✅ **`POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` confirms a created shipment and persists it** — Test `confirms_a_created_shipment_and_returns_it` creates S-1, POSTs confirm, asserts 200 and status=CONFIRMED\n4. ✅ **Error responses are consistent** — Uses ConflictException (409) and ResourceNotFoundException (404), mapped through GlobalExceptionHandler with ApiError envelope\n5. ✅ **A repeated confirm succeeds; a cancelled shipment is refused; an unknown id is refused** — Tests: `confirm_is_idempotent_on_confirmed_shipment` (200 twice), `rejects_confirming_a_cancelled_shipment_with_conflict` (409), `rejects_confirming_unknown_shipment_with_not_found` (404)\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency appears** — No pom.xml changes made\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** — Only modified: ShipmentController.kt (added endpoint), ApiError.kt (added error code)\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **ApiError.kt** — Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS` to ErrorCode enum (line 35). This is required by the ticket to signal a 409 when confirming a CANCELLED shipment. Unavoidable.\n\n2. **ShipmentController.kt** — Added `confirm()` method (lines 57-79). Implements the full POST endpoint with:\n   - Resource not found → ResourceNotFou